{% assign lts_schedule = include.lts_schedule | default: site.data.learn_to_scull_schedule %}
{% assign cohort = include.cohort %}
{% assign program_number = cohort.name | default: page.lts_program_number | default: "[LTS#]" %}
{% assign instructors = cohort.coaches | default: page.instructors %}
{% assign public_site_url = site.url | append: site.baseurl %}
Hi {{ program_number }} Crew,<br><br>

Congratulations on completing Session 4 and the Learn to Scull program! It was great to see you integrate all the skills and row with more confidence today.<br><br>

**Key Achievements from Session 4**<br>
*   Integrated all previously learned skills.<br>
*   Developed confidence in river navigation, including bridge passage.<br>
*   Demonstrated readiness for continued supervised rowing and possible future independent-rowing approval.<br><br>

**Reflecting on Your Journey**<br>
Think about how far you've come in just four sessions! From learning the basic stroke on the erg to rowing with coach oversight on the river, you've built a strong foundation.<br><br>

**Continue Your Rowing Journey**<br>
Learn more about continuing with sculling: [Open Sculling Program Details]({{ public_site_url }}/for-learners/resources/open-sculling-program-details.html).<br>
The discounted four-week Open Sculling trial period immediately after {{ program_number }} is the recommended next step for eligible graduates. It runs {{ cohort.trial_dates | default: "[trial dates]" }} and is priced at {{ lts_schedule.trial_fee }} for rowers not already covered by the Open/Tech Summer Program or Full Season.<br>
*   {{ lts_schedule.open_tech_fee_exemption_note }}<br>
*   The trial dates are fixed for each Learn to Scull session, so please register promptly if you want to continue.<br>
*   Review the latest registration details on the [AARC Learn to Scull page]({{ lts_schedule.registration_url }}).<br>
*   For rowers paying separate LTS continuation fees, Phase 2 covers sculling only (no sweep) and begins right after your Learn to Scull class ends.<br><br>

We will be sending you a separate email shortly with information on next steps to continue your rowing journey with AARC.<br><br>

Thank you for being a fantastic participant! We hope to see you on the water again very soon.<br><br>

Best regards,<br><br>
{% include communication_templates/signature.liquid instructors=instructors lts_schedule=lts_schedule %}
